I can reproduce: 
```C#
JsonTypeInfo<Person> typeInfo = JsonContext.Default.Person;

string json = JsonSerializer.Serialize(new Person { Property = 42 }, typeInfo);
var person = JsonSerializer.Deserialize(json, typeInfo);

[JsonSerializable(typeof(Person))]
public sealed partial class JsonContext : JsonSerializerContext 
{
}

public class Person 
{
    [JsonPropertyName("Prop")]
    public int Property { get; init; }
}
```
This is a .NET 8 only issue, the fix for `required` and `init` properties in #79828 appears to not account for custom property names when doing constructor parameter info binding. We should fix this.
